  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* fix: use 0o600 for --remember config files by @skdishansachin in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1187\r\n* fix: harden existing remembered config permissions by @divyanshu-iitian in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1189\r\n* Fix/web receiver silent hang by @NICE-DEV226 in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1188\r\n* Fix/web receiver silent hang by @NICE-DEV226 in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1192\r\n* fix: reject receive paths through symlink parents by @divyanshu-iitian in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1191\r\n* fix: return error instead of panic in EncryptChaCha by @skdishansachin in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1190\r\n* docs: document --exclude-file flag by @sridhar-3009 in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1179\r\n* docs: add FlCroc to third-party GUI list by @sridhar-3009 in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1180\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/stale from 10 to 11 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1194\r\n* Add encrypted temporary stored transfers by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1196\r\n* fix: support NetBSD disk usage builds by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1198\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @skdishansachin made their first contribution in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1187\r\n* @NICE-DEV226 made their first contribution in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1188\r\n* @sridhar-3009 made their first contribution in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1179\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/schollz/croc/compare/v10.6.0...v10.7.0",
